    "people_bio_K7mRqZ": {
      "type": "people-bio",
      "blocks": {
        "leader_tariq": {
          "type": "leader",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/leader-image-page-2-47594569.png",
            "name": "Tariq Farid",
            "title": "The Founder and Chairman of Edible",
            "heading_text": "Tariq Farid, the Founder and Chairman of Edible. Embarking on an extraordinary journey from Pakistan to America at the age of 11, Tariq Farid’s story is a testament to the American dream.",
            "body_text": "<p>Growing up in West Haven, Connecticut, he developed an early affinity for entrepreneurship. Tariq’s journey unfolded at a local McDonald’s, where he discovered the transformative power of business systemization.</p><p>In a bold move at 17, armed with a $5,000 loan from family and friends, Tariq purchased a flower shop in East Haven, Connecticut, to open the first Edible Arrangements (now Edible) store in 1999. Within two years, he transformed a single store into four. The venture swiftly evolved into a flourishing franchise empire, with hundreds of stores worldwide.</p><p>Tariq’s strategic acumen not only shaped the company’s trajectory but also led him to found Netsolace® in 2001, a software platform offering cutting-edge technology solutions for franchise companies, including Edible. Growing the Edible ecosystem in 2003, he went on to found BerryDirect®, a global supply chain service provider offering reliable global sourcing, fulfillment services, and high-quality products.</p><p>Beyond the boardroom, Tariq’s commitment to philanthropy is equally remarkable. In 2013, he established the Tariq Farid Foundation, channeling nearly $1 million annually to causes worldwide, ranging from healthcare and education to supporting refugees and fighting childhood cancer. His commitment to giving back through his foundation reflects his dedication to making a positive difference in the lives of others.</p>",
            "image_position": "left",
            "enable_read_more": true,
            "read_more_label": "Read More",
            "read_less_label": "Read Less",
            "characters_limit": 150
          }
        },
        "leader_somia": {
          "type": "leader",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/leader-image-page-2-47594581.png",
            "name": "Somia Farid Silber",
            "title": "Chief Executive Officer",
            "heading_text": "Somia Farid Silber serves as the Chief Executive Officer of Edible Brands, a role she assumed in October 2024 after a transformative tenure as President.",
            "body_text": "<p>As CEO, Somia is dedicated to guiding her family-owned business into its next phase of creativity and expansion, steering the company toward innovative growth while honoring its heritage of delivering joy through fresh, handcrafted gifts.</p>",
            "image_position": "right",
            "enable_read_more": true,
            "read_more_label": "Read More",
            "read_less_label": "Read Less",
            "characters_limit": 150
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "leader_tariq",
        "leader_somia"
      ],
